<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Corporacion Geo starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Corporacion Geo starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston said on Tuesday analyst Rafael Elias-Linares had started coverage of Mexican construction company Corporacion Geo SA de CV with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Low-cost technology makes Geo one of the most competitive 'social-interest housing' builders,&quot; Elias-Linares wrote in a Jan 28 analysis.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 1.70 peso to 40.70 in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
